---
import { ROLES } from '../lib/gangrim-policy.mjs';
---
<div id="briefing-panel" role="tabpanel" class="chair-panel">
  <div class="chair-toolbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">BRIEF. QUESTION. DECIDE.</p><h2>보고하십시오. 핵심을 묻겠습니다.</h2><p>준비한 내용을 말씀해주세요. 가장 중요한 질문 하나로 판단의 빈틈을 짚겠습니다.</p></div><div class="chair-tools"><a class="btn sec" href="#briefing-summary">현재 요약 보기</a><button type="button" id="briefing-new" data-chat-action class="btn sec">새 브리핑</button></div></div>
  <details class="chair-resume"><summary>이전 대화 이어보기</summary><form id="briefing-resume"><label>대화번호<input id="briefing-resume-id" required autocomplete="off"/></label><label>조회키<input id="briefing-resume-token" type="password" required autocomplete="off"/></label><button class="btn sec" data-chat-action type="submit">대화 불러오기</button></form></details>
  <div class="chair-grid">
    <section class="chair-conversation" aria-label="강림선생과 보고 대화">
      <div id="briefing-log" class="chair-log" role="log" aria-label="브리핑과 핵심 문답" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text"></div>
      <p id="briefing-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">긴 양식 없이 브리핑부터 시작하세요. 질문과 답변은 비공개로 저장됩니다.</p>
      <div id="briefing-composer"><form id="briefing-form">
        <div id="briefing-initial" class="chair-meta"><label>보고자 <small>선택</small><input id="briefing-author" maxlength="100" placeholder="이름 또는 업무용 별칭"/></label><label>검토 관점<select id="briefing-role">{ROLES.map(role=><option>{role}</option>)}</select></label></div>
        <label><span id="briefing-message-label">준비하신 내용을 자유롭게 브리핑해주세요</span><textarea id="briefing-message" rows="6" maxlength="16000" required></textarea></label>
        <label class="chair-files">자료 첨부 <small>PDF·DOCX·TXT·MD · 대화당 3개 / 파일당 5MB / 합계 10MB</small><input id="briefing-files" type="file" accept=".pdf,.docx,.txt,.md" multiple/></label>
        <div id="briefing-consent-row"><p class="chair-privacy">시험 운영 중입니다. 가상·비식별 자료로 테스트해주세요. 대화와 문서는 서버에 저장되고 AI 검토 시 OpenAI API로 전달됩니다. 자동 삭제되지 않으며 삭제 요청은 연락 메뉴로 보내주세요. 조회키 보유자와 최종 결정권자만 열람할 수 있습니다. 개인정보·기밀과 제출 권한 없는 자료는 제외해주세요.</p><label class="chair-check"><input id="briefing-consent" type="checkbox" required/> 제출 권한이 있으며 자료 처리 안내를 확인했습니다.</label></div>
        <div class="chair-send-row"><button id="briefing-example" type="button" class="btn sec" data-chat-action>가상 브리핑 예시</button><button id="briefing-send" type="submit" class="btn pri" data-chat-action>브리핑하고 핵심 질문 받기</button></div>
      </form></div>
      <button id="briefing-open-report" type="button" class="btn pri" data-chat-action hidden>확정 보고서 열기</button>
    </section>
    <aside id="briefing-summary" class="chair-summary" aria-label="현재 보고 요약">
      <p class="eyebrow">DECISION NOTES</p><h3>현재 보고 요약</h3><p id="briefing-empty-summary">브리핑을 시작하시면 결정할 사안, 핵심 쟁점과 보완 과제를 정리합니다.</p>
      <div id="briefing-summary-content" hidden><p id="briefing-stage" class="chair-stage"></p><h4>결정할 사안</h4><p id="briefing-decision"></p><h4>핵심 쟁점</h4><p id="briefing-issue"></p><h4>보완 과제</h4><ol id="briefing-tasks"></ol></div>
      <details id="briefing-receipt" hidden><summary>대화번호 · 조회키 보관</summary><p>탭을 닫으면 화면에서 사라집니다. 조회키는 다시 발급되지 않습니다.</p><label>대화번호<input id="briefing-id" readonly/></label><label>조회키<input id="briefing-token" readonly type="password"/></label><button type="button" id="briefing-export" class="btn sec">보관 정보 내려받기</button></details>
      <section id="briefing-confirm" hidden><details class="chair-draft"><summary>정리된 보고서 전체 확인</summary><div id="briefing-draft"></div></details><form id="briefing-confirm-form"><div id="briefing-author-confirm-wrap"><label>최종 보고자<input id="briefing-final-author" required maxlength="100"/></label><label>최종 마감<input id="briefing-deadline" type="datetime-local" required/></label></div><label class="chair-check"><input id="briefing-draft-agree" type="checkbox" required/> 정리된 보고서를 확인했습니다.</label><button type="submit" class="btn pri" data-chat-action>확인한 내용으로 보고서 확정</button></form></section>
      <p class="chair-human">강림선생은 AI 사전검토자입니다.<br/>최종 결정은 사람 강병준이 합니다.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
<script>import '../scripts/briefing';</script>
<style>
.chair-panel label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.chair-panel input:not([type=checkbox]),.chair-panel textarea,.chair-panel select{width:100%;min-height:46px;min-width:0;background:#0c0626;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:9px;padding:12px 14px;font:400 15px/1.6 var(--font)}.chair-panel textarea{resize:vertical}.chair-panel input::placeholder,.chair-panel textarea::placeholder{color:#aaa2c4}.chair-panel small{font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-3);line-height:1.7}.chair-tools{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.chair-tools .btn{font-size:12px}.chair-panel [hidden]{display:none!important}.chair-summary{scroll-margin-top:90px}.chair-log :global(article){scroll-margin-top:100px}.chair-panel button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}
.chair-panel{padding:30px 0}.chair-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:24px}.chair-toolbar h2{font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.4;margin:10px 0}.chair-toolbar p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--fg-2);font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}.chair-resume{padding:16px 20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:24px}.chair-resume summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}.chair-resume form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:end;margin-top:20px}.chair-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.65fr) minmax(280px,1fr);gap:26px;align-items:start}.chair-conversation{min-width:0}.chair-log{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}.chair-log :global(article){border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--surface)}.chair-log :global(.chair-welcome){font-size:19px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--fg)}.chair-log :global(.chair-user){margin-left:32px;background:#1e1338}.chair-log :global(.chair-assistant){border-left:3px solid var(--accent);margin-right:12px}.chair-log :global(.chair-speaker){display:block;color:var(--accent-3);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;letter-spacing:.03em}.chair-log :global(h3){font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;margin:18px 0 8px}.chair-log :global(p),.chair-log :global(li){white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:15px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--fg-2)}.chair-log :global(ol){padding-left:22px}.chair-log :global(small){display:block;margin-top:12px;color:var(--fg-3)}.chair-log :global(.chair-verdict){display:inline-block;color:var(--mint);font-size:13px;margin-top:18px}.chair-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.chair-summary{position:sticky;top:100px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#23143e,#100822);padding:26px;min-width:0}.chair-summary h3{font-size:23px;margin:12px 0 24px}.chair-summary h4{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent-3);margin:22px 0 8px}.chair-summary p,.chair-summary li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--fg-2);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.chair-summary ol{padding-left:20px}.chair-summary details{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}.chair-summary summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.chair-summary label{margin-top:16px}.chair-summary .btn{margin-top:18px;width:100%;text-align:center;white-space:normal}.chair-summary input{min-width:0}.chair-summary .chair-stage{color:var(--mint);font-size:12px}.chair-summary .chair-human{font-size:12px;margin-top:26px;color:var(--fg-3)}#briefing-form{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:26px;margin-top:26px}.chair-files{margin-top:18px}.chair-send-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}.chair-send-row .btn{white-space:normal;text-align:center}.chair-panel .chair-check{display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;margin-top:16px}.chair-check input{margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0;accent-color:var(--accent)}.chair-privacy{font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-3);line-height:1.9;margin-top:18px}#briefing-status{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--mint);margin-top:20px;white-space:pre-wrap}#briefing-confirm{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:20px}.chair-draft :global(p){margin-top:8px}.chair-summary .eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-3)}@media(max-width:800px){.chair-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chair-summary{position:static}.chair-toolbar{flex-direction:column}.chair-meta,.chair-resume form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chair-log :global(.chair-user){margin-left:16px}.chair-log :global(article){padding:20px}.chair-send-row .btn{width:100%}.chair-toolbar .btn{font-size:13px}}
</style>
